Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test(semantics): verify rational source correspondence
 fixtures

Observe six fixtures through runValidated and compare with independent global fibers. Include UID/domain/profile admission controls and full-domain diagonal output. All six mutation cycles failed at their intended fixture and restored byte-identically; the full default build passed. These are fixture-input mutations, not lowering implementation mutation coverage.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
