 ## Current artifact
 
+`Source` is an authoring prototype, not a production DSL adapter. It resolves
+bare UID read/output strings against supplied finite contexts and lowers read
+products plus term-local contractions to existing `Expr`/`Program`.
+`Source.pure_correspondence` connects nested-reduction interpretation and
+collection to an independent global-fiber formula over a generic semiring.
+The single-defined-target profile makes every other tensor an input.
+UID-keyed valuation equivalence, capture-avoiding source substitution,
+multi-statement permutation, and the production adapter are not supplied.
+`Semantics.SourceCorrespondenceTest` compares exact rational reference execution
+with that formula; no supplied model witness is used.
+
 `ExecutableState`, `ExecutableSelection`, and `ReferenceExecutor` realize the
 same reference `Step` edges computationally, with function-valued typed stores.
 Provide computational tensor equality and a complete, duplicate-free ordered
